factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says the heavy rain fell in 'திருச்சி நகரில்' (Trichy city) only, while the article says it covered the city and the outskirts of Trichy district.
  The reel_script and slides say rain fell 'from 12 noon' but omit that the rain began as light rain in the outskirts at 12 noon and became heavy at 1 pm, a detail mixed or missing.
  The reel_script omits that the rain was continuous for 3 hours and the drizzle continued afterwards only partially; the article's key context that rain continued for several days under a low-pressure area is missing.
  The slide 'என்ன பாதிப்பு?' lists 'பொதுமக்கள், விவசாயிகள் மகிழ்ச்சி அடைந்தனர்' (people and farmers were happy), which is a reaction, not a damage/impact, mislabeling the fact.
  The caption says the Chennai-area weather centre linkage 'தமிழகத்தில் கனமழை நீடிப்பதாக வானிலை ஆய்வு மையம் தெரிவித்துள்ளது' correctly reflects the article, but the caption also says 'Trichy news' in English as a hashtag-line; this is acceptable. However, the caption's first line says 'திருச்சி நகரில்' while the body says 'திருச்சி மாவட்டத்தில்', an inconsistency in location scope.
