factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script says Karthikeyan 'complained' (புகார் அளித்துள்ளார்) that money was taken for an Australia job; the article says the money was given to the accused, which is consistent, but the reel_script also states Rs 16 lakh was 'பெறப்பட்டதாக' — acceptable. However, the reel_script omits that the four people named in the case are the parents and daughters of the accused family (தாய், தந்தை, மகள்கள்), a key fact about who was charged, and it does not name the accused as Senthilkumar's family from Trichy Ponmalai.
  The slides_spec 'வழக்குப் பதிவு' slide says the case was filed against 'திருச்சி பொன்மலையைச் சேர்ந்த செந்தில்குமார் குடும்பத்தினர்' and '4 பேர்', which mixes the accused's location with the police action; the article says the complaint was by Karthikeyan, while the slide's 'யார் கொடுத்தார்?' heading attributes only the money-giving and the threat without clarifying the threat was made by the accused.
  The slides_spec line 'பணத்தைக் கேட்டபோது கொலை மிரட்டல் விடுத்ததாகவும் புகார்' sits under 'யார் கொடுத்தார்?' (who gave), which is a mismatched heading: the threat was made by the accused, not by the person who gave money.
  The caption states the accused include 'அகிலா' and 'யுவஸ்ரீ, லோகேஸ்வரி' as accused parties, which matches the article, but the caption's claim that the complaint was against 'செந்தில்குமார்' while the article names him as father; the caption does not say the case was filed against four people including parents and daughters explicitly in the reel, creating inconsistency.
